{"seq":3,"slug":"architectural-history","title":"建筑历史","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"建筑历史\">建筑历史</h1><p>建筑是人类文明最持久的物质载体。从尼罗河畔的金字塔到 2026 年封顶的圣家族大教堂，每一座建筑都凝结着特定时代的技术能力、审美理想和社会结构。理解建筑历史，不仅是认识砖石与空间的演变，更是透过物质形态阅读人类文明的精神脉络。</p>\n<p>本知识中心按时间线索将世界建筑史划分为四个章节：古代与古典时期、中世纪与文艺复兴、现代运动、当代建筑。每个章节聚焦关键文明区域的代表性建筑类型、结构创新与美学突破，同时关注不同文化圈之间的交流与影响。贯穿全书的核心问题是「为什么这样建」——技术条件、宗教信仰、政治权力与经济基础如何共同塑造了我们今天看到的建成环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>「建筑历史」回答的是<strong>纵向的「何时、为何演变」</strong>——风格、流派、结构范式如何在时间中递进。它与同属「建筑与城市」的兄弟 hub 在视角上互补，不重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>视角</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../architectural-design/\">建筑设计</a></td>\n<td>如何做设计</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲历史范式，设计 hub 讲当代方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../structural-materials/\">结构与材料</a></td>\n<td>力学怎样成立</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲穹顶/拱券/框架的历史，结构 hub 讲其力学原理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../urban-planning/\">城市规划</a></td>\n<td>城市尺度</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲单体与广场，城市 hub 讲区域与政策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../sustainable-net-zero-architecture/\">可持续与净零建筑</a></td>\n<td>碳与能源</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲材料史，可持续 hub 讲全生命周期碳核算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../heritage-conservation/\">遗产保护</a></td>\n<td>如何保存</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲建筑本体，遗产 hub 讲修复理论与技术</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../computational-design-digital-fabrication/\">计算性设计与数字建造</a></td>\n<td>数字工具</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲参数化的历史脉络，数字 hub 讲算法与建造细节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>凡涉及力学原理、修复技术、能耗核算、算法实现等纵深内容，本 hub 仅点到为止并以相对路径链接到对应兄弟 hub，避免内容重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[第1章&lt;br/&gt;古代与古典&lt;br/&gt;梁柱·拱券·木构] --&gt; B[第2章&lt;br/&gt;中世纪与文艺复兴&lt;br/&gt;骨架·穹顶·几何]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第3章&lt;br/&gt;现代运动&lt;br/&gt;新材料·框架·宣言]&#10;    C --&gt; D[第4章&lt;br/&gt;当代建筑&lt;br/&gt;批判·数字·净零]\">flowchart LR\n    A[第1章&lt;br/&gt;古代与古典&lt;br/&gt;梁柱·拱券·木构] --&gt; B[第2章&lt;br/&gt;中世纪与文艺复兴&lt;br/&gt;骨架·穹顶·几何]\n    B --&gt; C[第3章&lt;br/&gt;现代运动&lt;br/&gt;新材料·框架·宣言]\n    C --&gt; D[第4章&lt;br/&gt;当代建筑&lt;br/&gt;批判·数字·净零]</pre><p>建议<strong>按时间顺序</strong>通读，因为每个时代的突破都建立在前代的结构遗产之上（罗马拱券→哥特骨架→现代框架是一条贯穿全书的技术主线）。若时间有限，可选两条主题线索快速串读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>结构演化线</strong>：<a href=\"ancient-classical/egyptian-mesopotamian\">埃及与两河流域</a> → <a href=\"ancient-classical/greek-roman-architecture\">希腊罗马</a> → <a href=\"medieval-renaissance/gothic-architecture\">哥特式</a> → <a href=\"modern-movement/industrial-revolution-impact\">工业革命</a> → <a href=\"contemporary-architecture/21st-century-trends\">21世纪趋势</a></li>\n<li><strong>东方/非西方线</strong>：<a href=\"ancient-classical/chinese-traditional\">中国传统建筑</a> → <a href=\"medieval-renaissance/islamic-architecture\">伊斯兰建筑</a> → <a href=\"contemporary-architecture/regionalism-vernacular\">地域主义与乡土建筑</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>本 hub 面向通识读者，无硬性前置要求。若希望读得更深：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>想理解「为什么这样能立住」，可并读 <a href=\"../structural-materials/structural-systems/\">结构与材料 · 结构体系</a>（拱、券、穹顶、框架的力学）</li>\n<li>想理解材料革命的工程细节，可并读 <a href=\"../structural-materials/building-materials/\">结构与材料 · 建筑材料</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"建筑史为什么仍然重要\">建筑史为什么仍然重要</h2><p>建筑史的价值不仅在于回顾过去，更在于为当代设计提供参照系。当我们讨论可持续建筑、地域性表达或数字化建造时，历史中积累的智慧——材料的诚实使用、结构与形式的统一、建筑与环境的对话——依然是最根本的设计原则。两河流域在材料匮乏中发明拱券、中国木构「过程优于永恒」的态度、哥特「形式追随结构」的骨架逻辑，都在当代议程（隐含碳、循环材料、参数化）中获得了新的生命。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ancient-classical","title":"古代与古典建筑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/ancient-classical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"egyptian-mesopotamian","title":"埃及与两河流域建筑 Egyptian & Mesopotamian Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/ancient-classical/egyptian-mesopotamian"},{"seq":2,"slug":"greek-roman-architecture","title":"古希腊罗马建筑 Greek & Roman Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/ancient-classical/greek-roman-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chinese-traditional","title":"中国传统建筑 Chinese Traditional Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/ancient-classical/chinese-traditional"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"medieval-renaissance","title":"中世纪与文艺复兴建筑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/medieval-renaissance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gothic-architecture","title":"哥特式建筑 Gothic Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/medieval-renaissance/gothic-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"renaissance-baroque","title":"文艺复兴与巴洛克建筑 Renaissance & Baroque Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/medieval-renaissance/renaissance-baroque"},{"seq":3,"slug":"islamic-architecture","title":"伊斯兰建筑 Islamic Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/medieval-renaissance/islamic-architecture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-movement","title":"现代建筑运动","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/modern-movement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-revolution-impact","title":"工业革命与建筑变革 Industrial Revolution & Architectural Transformation","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/modern-movement/industrial-revolution-impact"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bauhaus-international-style","title":"包豪斯与国际式 Bauhaus & International Style","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/modern-movement/bauhaus-international-style"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modernism-masters","title":"现代主义大师 Modernism Masters","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/modern-movement/modernism-masters"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary-architecture","title":"当代建筑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/contemporary-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"postmodernism-deconstructivism","title":"后现代与解构主义 Postmodernism & Deconstructivism","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/contemporary-architecture/postmodernism-deconstructivism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"regionalism-vernacular","title":"地域主义与乡土建筑 Regionalism & Vernacular Architecture","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/contemporary-architecture/regionalism-vernacular"},{"seq":3,"slug":"21st-century-trends","title":"21世纪建筑趋势 21st Century Architecture Trends","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-history/contemporary-architecture/21st-century-trends"}]}]}